lothlorien.message.lore.where.none.woodwright=V naší vsi už tesař není, proto žádám místo něj já. Přineste to mně; v jiných vsích tesaře možná ještě mají.
## Context: Fallback line under a request of the lamplighter: no lamplighter lives near the Loremaster, so he takes the request himself and says other villages may still have one. Address the player without assuming gender; "their" is neutral.
lothlorien.message.lore.where.none.lamplighter=V naší vsi už lampář není, proto žádám místo něj já. Přineste to mně; v jiných vsích lampáře možná ještě mají.
## Context: Second line of the current-task button (green) when a request of the gardener is ready: it is handed over to the gardener, not to the Loremaster.
lothlorien.message.lore.status.bring.gardener=§aPřineste to zahradníkovi
## Context: Second line of the current-task button (green) when a request of the healer is ready: it is handed over to the healer, not to the Loremaster.
lothlorien.message.lore.status.bring.healer=§aPřineste to léčiteli
## Context: Second line of the current-task button (green) when a request of the woodwright is ready: it is handed over to the woodwright, not to the Loremaster.
lothlorien.message.lore.status.bring.woodwright=§aPřineste to tesaři
## Context: Second line of the current-task button (green) when a request of the lamplighter is ready: it is handed over to the lamplighter, not to the Loremaster.
lothlorien.message.lore.status.bring.lamplighter=§aPřineste to lampáři
## Context: Button on the small form of a trader elf that hands the ready request over (items are taken from the pack, or the planted saplings are counted). Shown only when the request is ready.
lothlorien.message.lore.btn.handover=Odevzdat
## Context: Interaction prompt for handing the current request over to the elf (opens the small form with the request). Shown only to a player who carries a request of this elf’s profession.
action.interact.lothlorien.hand_over=Odevzdat
## Context: Chat line when the player sets a Mallorn sapling outside the Lothlorien biome while the current Loremaster task is 'plant five Mallorn acorns'. That sapling is not counted. Grey.
lothlorien.message.lore.saplings.outside=§7Tato sazenice stojí mimo Zlatý les; nezapočítává se.
## Context: The trader refuses a player whose Harmony is Shunned, including a player carrying a request. Peaceful conduct in the forest can restore access; no request form or trade screen opens.
lothlorien.message.trade.refused.shunned=§7Elf s vámi nebude obchodovat. Naučte se žít v míru s lesem a pak se vraťte.
## Context: The trader refuses a player whose Harmony is Hated, including a player carrying a request. No request form or trade screen opens.
lothlorien.message.trade.refused.hated=§7Elf se odvrací a nebude s vámi obchodovat.
## Context: The elf’s offers are prepared for this player. The player must interact with the same elf again to open the native trade screen; selecting Trade in a request form grants a short pass for this next interaction.
lothlorien.message.trade.again=§7Elf je připraven obchodovat. Znovu oslovte tohoto elfa.
## Context: Button in a trader’s request form. It closes the form and permits the player’s next interaction with this elf to open the native trade screen; the request remains active.
lothlorien.message.lore.btn.trade=Obchodovat
## Context: Developer diagnostic for the nearest trader: localized profession, its current table key, the invoking player’s eligible key and current trade-pass state. Technical keys and pass values are supplied verbatim.
lothlorien.message.trade.debug=Ladění obchodu: %s, tabulka %s, vaše %s, oprávnění %s
## Context: Selecting Trade closes the request form. The player must then click the same elf again to open the native trade screen. This instruction is shown before selecting the button.
lothlorien.message.lore.btn.trade_hint=Pak znovu klikněte na elfa
## Context: Chest armour with leather-level protection. Grants invisibility after sneaking without moving for one second.
item.lothlorien:elven_cloak=Elfí plášť
## Context: Elven bow with a faster draw, native bow enchantments and vanilla arrow flight. Galadhrim is a lore proper name.
item.lothlorien:bow=Luk Galadhrim
## Context: Off-hand gift rendered at the waist; grants Regeneration I while health is strictly below half maximum.
item.lothlorien:silver_belt=Stříbrný opasek
## Context: Off-hand gift that lights nearby air and repels spiders. Galadriel is a lore proper name; phial means a small vial.
item.lothlorien:phial_of_galadriel=Galadrielina lahvička
## Context: Recoverable arrow ammunition fired only by the Bow of the Galadhrim in Survival; same trajectory as a vanilla arrow.
item.lothlorien:galadhrim_arrow=Šíp Galadhrim
## Context: Recoverable arrow ammunition fired only by the Bow of the Galadhrim in Survival; same trajectory as a vanilla arrow.
entity.lothlorien:galadhrim_arrow.name=Šíp Galadhrim
## Context: Invisible temporary air-space light used by the Phial of Galadriel; hidden from creative inventory and drops nothing.
tile.lothlorien:phial_light.name=Světlo lahvičky
## Context: The player tried to draw an ordinary (vanilla) bow while carrying Galadhrim arrows and no normal arrows, so it did not draw. Deliberately vague: say only that an ordinary bow cannot shoot them; do not name the elven bow. Galadhrim is a lore proper name; the arrow name should match its item translation.
lothlorien.message.archery.normal_bow=§7Obyčejný luk šípy Galadhrim nevystřelí.
## Context: A raw, edible cut of meat dropped by an adult swan; can be cooked.
item.lothlorien:swan_meat_raw=Syrové labutí maso
## Context: The cooked edible cut of swan meat, made in a furnace, smoker or campfire.
item.lothlorien:swan_meat_cooked=Pečené labutí maso
## Context: Captured firefly name. Long names continue on additional lore lines; the captured identity, not the anvil bottle title, is restored.
lothlorien.message.firefly.name=Světluška: %s
## Context: Continuation of a captured firefly name on its own tooltip line. Do not add punctuation or change the name.
lothlorien.message.firefly.name_more=%s
## Context: Captured firefly current health in health points, not hearts. Only injured or nondefault-health captures need this lore line.
lothlorien.message.firefly.health=Zdraví: %s
